<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11775] IgnitePdsWithTtlTest is flaky</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11775</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It seems the reason for test failure is the fact that TTL manager cannot clean up all entries because of TTL throttling (see &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheTtlManager#expire&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheOffheapManager.GridCacheDataStore#purgeExpired&lt;/tt&gt;). It does not seem a bug/problem, it just required to set the &lt;tt&gt;IgniteSystemProperties.IGNITE_UNWIND_THROTTLING_TIMEOUT&lt;/tt&gt; to a smaller value.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
